        "severity": "advice",
        "problem": "The 112 px serif title wraps into three lines and splits the word 安排 across lines 1–2 (“两种阅读安 / 排尚未形成 / 统一决定”). Because the line box is only ~810 px wide, the block also leaves the entire right half of the 1280×720 stage empty, so the opener reads as a narrow column pinned to the left rather than a deliberate title composition.",
        "correction": "Keep the wording and both [1][2] markers exactly as they are; reduce the heading size to about 84–92 px (or widen the title column toward ~1,050 px) so 安排 stays on one line and the title sets in two balanced lines that use more of the stage width.",
        "route": "layout"
      },
      {
        "slideId": "reading-zh-p2",
        "blockId": null,
        "severity": "advice",
        "problem": "The heading and three bullets occupy only y≈60–335 of the 720 px stage, ending roughly 385 px short of the bottom edge. On a reading-handout page this reads as a page that stopped early rather than intentional breathing room, and the large empty band competes with the 34 px body text for attention.",
        "correction": "Redistribute the existing content vertically without changing any text: either add more space between the bullets so the list fills more of the column, or shift the heading-plus-list group down so the top and bottom margins balance.",
        "route": "layout"
      },
      {
        "slideId": "reading-zh-p2",
        "blockId": null,
        "severity": "advice",
        "problem": "The third item, 证据范围：讨论意见没有测量学习效果。 [1][2], is the limiting qualification that constrains the headline, yet it is set identically to the two substantive claims above it and reads as a third co-equal bullet. The page therefore does not visually distinguish the claims from their evidence limit, which is the point of this page.",
